Package: ntlgini
Title: Global Subnational Nighttime-Light Gini Evolution (1992-2024)
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Mohamed Dhia", "Hammami", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "med.dhia.hammami@gmail.com")
Description: Provides harmonized 1992-2024 nighttime-light Gini coefficients
    and Pyatt/Dagum within, between, and overlap decompositions across
    administrative levels (ADM_1 to ADM_4) for 228 countries and territories,
    derived from Cheng et al. (2026) <doi:10.5194/essd-18-3449-2026> 500 m
    'VIIRS'-like nighttime lights and 'GADM' 4.1 boundaries. Subunit-level
    'Parquet' tables are downloaded on demand and cached locally.
